Package: aegis
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aegis <ops@aegis.local>
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Pre-Depends: debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0
Depends: ca-certificates, docker.io | docker-ce | docker-ee
Recommends: docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin
Conflicts: aegis-server
Replaces: aegis-server
Description: Aegis platform (Brain, Link, dashboard, PostgreSQL, Redis, Caddy)
 Installs the complete Aegis server and dashboard stack, including Brain, Link,
 the frontend, PostgreSQL, Redis, Caddy and backup, plus a systemd unit that
 builds the images from the packaged source and brings the stack up at boot.
 The endpoint agent is a separate package because it is installed on Windows
 and Linux endpoints, not on the server. Docker Engine with the Compose v2
 plugin is required. The first start needs network access to build the images.
Homepage: https://github.com/Terminalkid09/aegis-ecosystem
